{"seq":1,"slug":"flash-strobe","title":"闪光灯与频闪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/lighting-and-flash/lighting-gear/flash-strobe","wordCount":1560,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"闪光灯与频闪\">闪光灯与频闪</h1><p>闪光灯能在两万分之一秒里倾泻出比阳光还猛的瞬时光，又能用毫秒级的频闪把一滴牛奶皇冠般的飞溅凝固成一串水珠——这种「极短时间内集中爆发」的特性，是它和持续光源最本质的分野。理解闪光的能量、时长与同步逻辑，是从「按下快门碰运气」走向「精确控光」的分水岭。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>闪光灯靠给电容充电、再瞬间放电点亮氙气闪光管发光。它有两条关键性能轴：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>输出能量</strong>：影室闪光（monolight / 棚灯）用瓦秒（Ws / Joule）标称储能；机顶闪光（speedlight）用<a href=\"../light-physics/intensity-inverse-square\">闪光指数</a> GN 标称有效照射力。</li>\n<li><strong>闪光时长</strong>（flash duration）：从点亮到熄灭的时间，决定能否「凝固」运动。常分为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0.5</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{0.5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（亮度降到一半的时长）和更严格的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0.1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{0.1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（降到 1/10 的时长，更接近真实凝固能力）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>闪光时长越短，凝固运动越锐利。高端棚灯在小功率档可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0.1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{0.1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 约 1/10000 秒甚至更短。一个反直觉规律：<strong>多数棚灯功率开得越小，闪光时长越短</strong>（电容放电更快），所以拍高速凝固时往往要降功率、靠拉近补光。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[闪光灯] --&gt; B[输出能量&lt;br/&gt;棚灯 Ws · 机顶 GN]&#10;    A --&gt; C[闪光时长&lt;br/&gt;t0.5 / t0.1]&#10;    A --&gt; D[触发与同步&lt;br/&gt;TTL / 手动 · 前后帘]&#10;    C --&gt; E[时长短&lt;br/&gt;凝固运动 · 频闪]&#10;    B --&gt; F[配合平方反比定律&lt;br/&gt;定光圈]&#10;    D --&gt; G[与快门配合&lt;br/&gt;受同步速度限制]\">flowchart TD\n    A[闪光灯] --&gt; B[输出能量&lt;br/&gt;棚灯 Ws · 机顶 GN]\n    A --&gt; C[闪光时长&lt;br/&gt;t0.5 / t0.1]\n    A --&gt; D[触发与同步&lt;br/&gt;TTL / 手动 · 前后帘]\n    C --&gt; E[时长短&lt;br/&gt;凝固运动 · 频闪]\n    B --&gt; F[配合平方反比定律&lt;br/&gt;定光圈]\n    D --&gt; G[与快门配合&lt;br/&gt;受同步速度限制]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>典型功率</th>\n<th>回电速度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>机顶闪光（speedlight）</td>\n<td>GN 约 36–60</td>\n<td>较慢</td>\n<td>外拍、补光、轻便</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>便携锂电棚灯</td>\n<td>200–600 Ws</td>\n<td>0.01–1.5 s</td>\n<td>外拍主力、影室</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>影室插电棚灯</td>\n<td>400–1200 Ws</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>商业棚、产品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电箱+灯头系统</td>\n<td>1200–4800 Ws</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>大场景、高速凝固</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>主流 HSS 兼容机型如 Godox V1、Canon Speedlite 600EX-RT、Nikon SB-5000、Sony HVL-F60RM，外拍配 200–400 Ws 便携棚灯较常见（来源：<a href=\"https://fstoppers.com/lighting/improve-your-flash-photography-high-speed-sync-688121\">Fstoppers HSS 指南</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ttl-与手动-自动方便-vs-一致可控\">TTL 与手动：自动方便 vs 一致可控</h2><p>闪光出力有两种控制哲学：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>TTL</strong>（Through The Lens）：相机先发一次预闪测光，自动算出主闪出力。优点是快、适应光线变化；缺点是同一场景多拍几张出力可能漂移，不利于需要一致曝光的商业连拍。</li>\n<li><strong>手动（M）</strong>：人为设定固定出力（如 1/4、1/16）。优点是每一张完全一致、可复现；缺点是机位或距离一变就得重设。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>经验法则：<strong>抓拍、活动、光线多变用 TTL；棚拍、产品、需要逐张一致用手动</strong>。专业棚拍几乎全程手动，因为可控性压倒便利性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"同步速度-闪光与快门的契约\">同步速度：闪光与快门的契约</h2><p>这是闪光摄影最容易翻车的概念。相机的焦平面快门由两片帘幕组成：前帘拉开露出感光面，后帘跟上盖住。<strong>只有当前帘完全打开、后帘尚未启动的那个「全开窗口」，整张传感器才同时受光</strong>——闪光必须在这一刻爆发。</p>\n<p>快门速度快到一定程度（多为 1/200 或 1/250 秒，即<strong>同步速度</strong>），两片帘幕来不及完全分开，而是以一条移动的缝隙扫过传感器。此时若普通闪光爆发，只有缝隙经过的那条被照亮，画面会出现一道黑带。</p>\n<p>突破这一限制的技术叫<strong>高速同步（HSS）</strong>：让闪光在快门缝隙扫过期间持续高频脉冲，相当于变成短暂的持续光，从而支持 1/8000 这样的高速快门。HSS 的代价是有效出力大幅下降，它的完整外拍应用见<a href=\"../scenarios/flash-hss-outdoor\">外拍闪光与高速同步</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[快门速度] --&gt; B{是否超过同步速度?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否 ≤1/200| C[普通闪光&lt;br/&gt;全开窗口爆发 · 满出力]&#10;    B --&gt;|是 &gt;1/200| D[需要 HSS&lt;br/&gt;脉冲持续 · 出力骤降]&#10;    C --&gt; E[前帘/后帘同步选择]&#10;    D --&gt; F[外拍压光 · 大光圈]\">graph TD\n    A[快门速度] --&gt; B{是否超过同步速度?}\n    B --&gt;|否 ≤1/200| C[普通闪光&lt;br/&gt;全开窗口爆发 · 满出力]\n    B --&gt;|是 &gt;1/200| D[需要 HSS&lt;br/&gt;脉冲持续 · 出力骤降]\n    C --&gt; E[前帘/后帘同步选择]\n    D --&gt; F[外拍压光 · 大光圈]</pre><h2 id=\"前帘同步与后帘同步\">前帘同步与后帘同步</h2><p>在慢速快门下，闪光在曝光的哪一刻爆发会改变运动拖影的方向：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>前帘同步</strong>（默认）：快门一开闪光就闪，凝固瞬间发生在曝光开始，之后的环境光拖影会拖在主体「前方」，看起来运动方向反了，显得别扭。</li>\n<li><strong>后帘同步</strong>：闪光在快门即将关闭前才闪，拖影留在主体身后，符合「运动留下尾迹」的直觉，拍车流、舞者甩动更自然。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"频闪-一次曝光多次爆发\">频闪：一次曝光多次爆发</h2><p>频闪（multi / stroboscopic）模式让闪光在一次快门内按设定频率连闪多次，每次爆发凝固运动的一个瞬间，最终在一张照片上叠出连续动作序列——经典的高尔夫挥杆分解、弹跳的小球轨迹都靠它。设置三要素：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>频率（Hz）</strong>：每秒闪几次，决定动作分解的密度。</li>\n<li><strong>次数</strong>：一次曝光闪多少下，受单灯总能量限制。</li>\n<li><strong>快门时长</strong>：必须长到足够容纳所有爆发，常用 1 秒甚至更长，因此通常在暗背景下拍以免环境光糊掉画面。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>频闪要求暗背景、深色衣物配合，否则多次曝光会让主体重叠处过曝。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选购与避坑\">选购与避坑</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>GN 标称水分大</strong>：厂商常用最大变焦（如 200mm）下的 GN 标称，等效广角时实际照射力小得多。比较时务必看同一焦距、同一 ISO 下的数值。</li>\n<li><strong>回电速度影响连拍</strong>：活动跟拍要看满功率回电时间，回电太慢会漏掉关键瞬间。</li>\n<li><strong>闪光时长看 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0.1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{0.1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0.5</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{0.5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong>：商家爱标好看的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0.5</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{0.5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，但真正决定凝固锐度的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0.1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{0.1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>触发系统要配套</strong>：HSS、TTL 依赖品牌协议，混用不同品牌的灯与触发器常导致功能失效，购买前确认协议兼容。</li>\n<li><strong>显色性</strong>：氙气闪光管光谱连续，显色性通常优于廉价 LED，这是其商业人像优势，对比见<a href=\"../light-physics/color-temperature-cri\">色温与显色性</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>闪光以瞬时高能爆发为本质，两条轴是输出能量（Ws / GN）与闪光时长（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0.1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{0.1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）。</li>\n<li>棚灯多为「功率越小、时长越短」，高速凝固靠降功率拉近补。</li>\n<li>TTL 自动适应、手动逐张一致；棚拍优先手动。</li>\n<li>同步速度（多为 1/200）是闪光与焦平面快门的契约，超过须用 HSS。</li>\n<li>前帘/后帘决定拖影方向；频闪在一帧内多次爆发叠出动作序列。</li>\n<li>选购看同焦距同 ISO 的 GN、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0.1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{0.1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、回电速度与触发协议兼容性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"闪光灯与频闪","id":"闪光灯与频闪"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"TTL 与手动：自动方便 vs 一致可控","id":"ttl-与手动-自动方便-vs-一致可控"},{"level":2,"text":"同步速度：闪光与快门的契约","id":"同步速度-闪光与快门的契约"},{"level":2,"text":"前帘同步与后帘同步","id":"前帘同步与后帘同步"},{"level":2,"text":"频闪：一次曝光多次爆发","id":"频闪-一次曝光多次爆发"},{"level":2,"text":"选购与避坑","id":"选购与避坑"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"色温与显色性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/lighting-and-flash/light-physics/color-temperature-cri"},"next":{"title":"持续光源","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/lighting-and-flash/lighting-gear/continuous-sources"}}